    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "MEASURED",
      "narration_text": "So I built one, and trained its codebooks on thirty-six short pieces of music I generated. Then I coded a piece it had never heard. With one codebook, it's dull and smeared: the treble is down by seventeen decibels. With four, clearer. With twelve, the treble is down by less than six. Listen: one codebook, four, twelve, then the original.",
