    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "PREDICT",
      "narration_text": "Now the model. A music model reads tokens and guesses the next one. Mine is tiny: it just counts which token tends to follow each pair. On music it had never heard, it guessed the next token right sixteen and a half percent of the time. A blind guess would be right one time in a thousand. That's the whole trick, at a vastly bigger scale: learn what comes next.",
