    {
      "beat_id": "B07",
      "act": "WHAT TO DO",
      "narration_text": "So when you prompt Suno for a Lyrical Literacy track, remember: the words shift the odds, they don't write the notes. Generate a few versions and choose. Name the instruments, the mood and the tempo, because those are what the text can steer. And check the treble on headphones: when sound is squeezed into tokens, the high end is the first thing to go.",
